### 1. Create a category (expect 201, id: 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dresses",
  "description": "Evening and party dresses"
}

### 4. Delete a category that still has products (expect 409)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/categories/1

### 7. Create a second category (expect 201, id: 2)
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bags"
}

### 10. Rename to an existing name (expect 409)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/categories/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dresses"
}
